From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Mar 2026 13:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add vendor health sensors (RR, temp, PPG, calories, RHR, off-body)

Wire remaining LifeQ and PAH8131 vendor sensors through sensorfw:
- Respiration rate (65574) - breaths per minute
- On-wrist temperature (65575) - skin temperature
- Raw PPG waveform (65572) - photodetector readings
- Calories (65573) - calorie estimation
- Daily resting HR (65581) - daily RHR
- Basal resting HR (65582) - basal RHR
- Off-body detection (34) - on/off wrist

All adaptors include debug logging to discover vendor event data layout.
Field mappings are preliminary (data[0]=value, data[1]=status).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate

Signed-off-by: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
---

